## result_type (exit 1)
error[Z0225]: `word` is declared to return a Str, but its body gives an Int
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:26
  |
2 | fn word(n: Int) -> Str { n }
  |                    --- the declared type
  |                          ^ an Int
  |
  = help: the body's last expression gives the declared type; Int is accepted for Float

## body_without_value (exit 1)
error[Z0225]: `share` is declared to return a Float, but its body ends without a value
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:26
  |
2 | fn share(data: Frame) -> Float {
