## recursion_through_another (exit 1)
error[Z0108]: a function may not call itself: `ping` calls `pong`, which calls `ping`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:4
  |
2 | fn ping(n: Int) -> Int { pong(n) }
  |    ^^^^ the cycle starts here
  |
  = help: iteration is `for` and `iterate` (section 5.5), so that every script finishes

## recursion_direct (exit 1)
error[Z0108]: a function may not call itself: `fact` calls itself
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:4
  |
2 | fn fact(n: Int) -> Int { n * fact(n - 1) }
  |    ^^^^ the cycle starts here
  |
  = help: iteration is `for` and `iterate` (section 5.5), so that every script finishes

## import_inside (exit 1)
error[Z0110]: `import` is allowed only in a script, not inside the function `load`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:22
  |
2 | fn load() -> Frame { import("data/small.csv") }
  |                      ^^^^^^ reads or writes outside the arguments
  |
  = help: a function's result depends on its arguments alone, so it may be cached; import the data in the script and pass the frame in

